second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which sports team does Justin Booty represent or represent?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 16, \"text\": \"**Justin Booty**\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 18, \"end\": 245, \"text\": \"Justin Booty (born 1976) is a British footballer who has made a surprising transition to professional basketball, currently playing for the Little Rock Trojans men's basketball team of the University of Arkansas at Little Rock.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 246, \"end\": 280, \"text\": \"**Early Life and Football Career**\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 282, \"end\": 336, \"text\": \"Booty was born on August 12, 1976, in London, England.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 337, \"end\": 424, \"text\": \"He began his football career at a young age, playing for various youth clubs in the UK.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 425, \"end\": 546, \"text\": \"In 1995, he signed with the English football club, Queens Park Rangers, where he played as a midfielder for five seasons.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 547, \"end\": 674, \"text\": \"Booty's impressive skills on the pitch earned him a transfer to the Scottish Premier League team, Heart of Midlothian, in 2000.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 675, \"end\": 763, \"text\": \"He spent three seasons with the team before retiring from professional football in 2003.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 764, \"end\": 792, \"text\": \"**Transition to Basketball**\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 794, \"end\": 903, \"text\": \"After his retirement from football, Booty took a break from competitive sports to focus on his personal life.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 904, \"end\": 1011, \"text\": \"However, in 2010, he began to explore his passion for basketball, a sport he had always been fascinated by.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1012, \"end\": 1119, \"text\": \"Booty started training with local basketball teams in the UK, honing his skills and building his endurance.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1120, \"end\": 1149, \"text\": \"**College Basketball Career**\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1151, \"end\": 1254, \"text\": \"In 2015, Booty made the unexpected decision to pursue a college basketball career in the United States.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1255, \"end\": 1375, \"text\": \"He enrolled at the University of Arkansas at Little Rock, where he joined the Little Rock Trojans men's basketball team.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1376, \"end\": 1484, \"text\": \"Despite being 39 years old at the time, Booty's athleticism and determination earned him a spot on the team.\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1485, \"end\": 1511, \"text\": \"**Studies and References**\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1513, \"end\": 1740, \"text\": \"A 2017 study published in the Journal of Sports Science and Medicine found that former football players like Booty possess a unique combination of strength, agility, and endurance that can be successfully adapted to basketball.\"}, \"D1S19\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1741, \"end\": 1893, \"text\": \"The study, titled \\\"Cross-Training in Elite Athletes: A Case Study of Football Players in Basketball,\\\" cited Booty as a prime example of this phenomenon.\"}, \"D1S20\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1894, \"end\": 1897, \"text\": \"[1]\"}, \"D1S21\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1899, \"end\": 2133, \"text\": \"In an interview with ESPN in 2018, Booty discussed his transition from football to basketball, stating, \\\"I've always loved the fast-paced nature of basketball, and I'm thrilled to have the opportunity to play at the collegiate level.\\\"\"}, \"D1S22\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2134, \"end\": 2137, \"text\": \"[2]\"}, \"D1S23\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2139, \"end\": 2157, \"text\": \"**Current Career**\"}, \"D1S24\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2159, \"end\": 2307, \"text\": \"Booty has become an integral part of the Little Rock Trojans men's basketball team, known for his tenacious defense and clutch three-point shooting.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 69, \"text\": \"Title: The Unlikely Hero of Colchester United: Justin Booty's Journey\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 71, \"end\": 249, \"text\": \"In the quaint town of Colchester, England, where the River Colne flows gently through the heart of the city, a sense of pride and community resonates deeply within its residents.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 250, \"end\": 408, \"text\": \"For the people of Colchester, their beloved football club, Colchester United F.C., is more than just a team - it's a symbol of unity, passion, and dedication.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 409, \"end\": 511, \"text\": \"And among the many talented players who have donned the U's jersey, one name stands out: Justin Booty.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 512, \"end\": 597, \"text\": \"Born in 1976, Justin Booty's journey to becoming a stalwart of Colchester United F.C.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 598, \"end\": 635, \"text\": \"was not without its twists and turns.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 636, \"end\": 728, \"text\": \"Growing up in a small town in England, Booty's love for football was ignited at a young age.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 729, \"end\": 828, \"text\": \"He spent countless hours honing his skills on the pitch, driven by an insatiable desire to succeed.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 829, \"end\": 947, \"text\": \"As he entered his teenage years, Booty's talent began to flourish, catching the attention of local scouts and coaches.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 948, \"end\": 1025, \"text\": \"In 1995, Booty's big break arrived when he signed with Colchester United F.C.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1026, \"end\": 1050, \"text\": \"as a young professional.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1051, \"end\": 1151, \"text\": \"The then-19-year-old midfielder was eager to prove himself, and his debut season did not disappoint.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1152, \"end\": 1274, \"text\": \"Booty's tenacity, vision, and goal-scoring prowess quickly made him a fan favorite at Layer Road, the club's home stadium.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1275, \"end\": 1379, \"text\": \"One of the most compelling pieces of evidence supporting Booty's affiliation with Colchester United F.C.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1380, \"end\": 1437, \"text\": \"is his impressive goal tally during the 1996-1997 season.\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1438, \"end\": 1582, \"text\": \"With 12 goals in 42 appearances, Booty emerged as one of the top scorers in the Third Division, earning him a reputation as a clinical finisher.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1583, \"end\": 1721, \"text\": \"This remarkable form did not go unnoticed, as Booty's performances caught the attention of bigger clubs, including Premier League outfits.\"}, \"D2S18\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1722, \"end\": 1772, \"text\": \"However, Booty's loyalty to Colchester United F.C.\"}, \"D2S19\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1773, \"end\": 1793, \"text\": \"remained unwavering.\"}, \"D2S20\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1794, \"end\": 1907, \"text\": \"He continued to be an integral part of the team, helping the U's secure promotion to the Second Division in 1998.\"}, \"D2S21\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1908, \"end\": 2054, \"text\": \"This achievement was a testament to Booty's dedication and the club's collective efforts, as they navigated the challenges of the lower divisions.\"}, \"D2S22\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2055, \"end\": 2119, \"text\": \"Further evidence of Booty's commitment to Colchester United F.C.\"}, \"D2S23\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2120, \"end\": 2164, \"text\": \"can be seen in his appearances for the club.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [], \"R5_answers\": [\"Little Rock Trojans\", \"Colchester United F.C.\", \"Queens Park Rangers\", \"Heart of Midlothian\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Little Rock Trojans\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"Colchester United F.C.\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C2\", \"answer\": \"Queens Park Rangers\",